==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*standaną}}. The verb occurred in two forms within Germanic, but only this form is attested in Old Norse sources. In the east, this form existed side by side with unattested {{m|non||*stá}} (from which Swedish {{m|sv|stå}}), from Proto-Germanic {{m|gem-pro|*stāną}}. Both ultimately derive from the same {{etyl|ine-pro|non}} {{m|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}.

===Verb===
{{non-verb}}

# to [[stand]]

====Conjugation====
{{rfinfl|non|verb}}
